;    0: TWdLink(count=815, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\生徒会室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\putting_a_box.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>"Heave-ho! Is that all of it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, thank you so much, </STYLE>Goto-senpai<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"By the way, is your speech for the upcoming entrance ceremony going okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes! Thanks to </STYLE>Goto-senpai's<STYLE ID="1"> advice, it's perfect!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Now it's just practice, practice!"</STYLE><PG>
"It's tough being president when you're a brand-new second-year. 
{PAUSE ""}
Practice is good, but make sure you get across what you really want to say. 
{PAUSE ""}
If you only read it by rote, I think it'll bore the people listening too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! I heard from my sister! About </STYLE>Goto-senpai's<STYLE ID="1"> legendary speech!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You tore up your paper during your entrance ceremony speech, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, that... 
{PAUSE ""}
Ahaha, thinking about it now, maybe that was a little childish..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But I heard everyone got really fired up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I'll try it too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It'd be a problem if it turned into a tradition... 
{PAUSE ""}
So you won't need to do something like that, make sure you get your own feelings across."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Understood!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But, </STYLE>Goto-senpai<STYLE ID="1">... is it all right? Always helping us like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What do you mean?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Your help really saves us, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You know, there's a </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of yours in the hospital, isn't there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, yeah, I go visit her in the hospital sometimes. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is always at her side, so there's no need for me to go that often too―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Somehow that just... doesn't sound like you, </STYLE>Goto-senpai<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Doesn't sound like me?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, wouldn't you normally take turns visiting with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">that senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Going to the hospital all the time is a pretty big burden, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's what I suggested at first, too. 
{PAUSE ""}
But <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> seems to get anxious if she doesn't see her face every day."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hey, </STYLE>Goto-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, isn't there some reason it's hard for you to go to the hospital?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"There isn't... anything like that."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"From what I hear, the reason <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> ended up like that is that she shielded <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
So somehow... it's a little hard to watch the way <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> acts in that hospital room..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... Sorry for asking something so pointless."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come on, the sun's already gone down. Let's go home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Uh, thank you for today, too!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------